# Pebble — PWA Chat Interface for Hermes

Quick install and launch for Hermes agents.

## Install & Start

Run the prebuilt binary — no npm or Node needed:

```bash
./release/pebble-macos-arm64
```

It reads the API key and port from `~/.hermes/.env`, starts a server on
`:5173` that **proxies** the Hermes API, and prints a ready-to-use launch URL.

Open the printed URL in a browser. Done.

## Launch URL format

```
http://localhost:5173/?hermes=http://localhost:5173&token=<key>
```

Note: `hermes` and the Pebble port are the **same** — Pebble proxies `/api/*`
to Hermes internally, so no CORS issues arise.

## Verify

```bash
curl http://localhost:5173/health
# Expected: {"status": "ok", "platform": "hermes-agent"}
```

## Rebuild binary (after code changes)

```bash
npm run build && go build -o release/pebble-macos-arm64 .
```

Cross-platform: `npm run build:binary` (requires Go).

